OL,3,AAmerican soldier arrested by UK police
OL,4,Aon suspicion of spying taken into US
OL,5,Amilitary custody
OL,6,
OL,7,FTyner was based at Imjin Barracks in
OL,8,FInnsworth, Gloucestershire, which
OL,9,Fserves as the headquarters of Nato's
OL,10,FAllied Rapid Reaction Corps (ARRC).
OL,12,FCounter Terror Policing said he has
OL,13,Fsince been taken into custody by the US
OL,14,Fmilitary over suspected national
OL,15,Fsecurity and espionage allegations.
